{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"18d605b76ce0ce8b7896c55a048971d827e454f0d479e5d953f3671430cf12f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我看見主站在祭壇旁邊；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他說：你要擊打柱頂，使門檻震動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎柱頂，落在眾人頭上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所剩下的人，我必用刀殺戮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無一人能逃避，無一人能逃脫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們雖然挖透陰間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的手必取出他們來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然爬上天去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必拿下他們來；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然藏在迦密山頂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必搜尋，捉出他們來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然從我眼前藏在海底，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必命蛇咬他們；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖被仇敵擄去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必命刀劍殺戮他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必向他們定住眼目，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"降禍不降福。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"主－萬軍之耶和華摸地，地就消化，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡住在地上的都必悲哀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必全然像尼羅河漲起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同埃及河落下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那在天上建造樓閣、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在地上安定穹蒼、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"命海水澆在地上的－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是他的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：以色列人哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈不看你們如古實人嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈不是領以色列人出埃及地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領非利士人出迦斐託，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領亞蘭人出吉珥嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華的眼目察看這有罪的國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必將這國從地上滅絕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不將雅各家滅絕淨盡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"我必出令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將以色列家分散在列國中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像用篩子篩穀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"連一粒也不落在地上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我民中的一切罪人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"災禍必追不上我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也迎不着我們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必死在刀下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的未來復興"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"到那日，我必建立大衛倒塌的帳幕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"堵住其中的破口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把那破壞的建立起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"重新修造，像古時一樣，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使以色列人得以東所餘剩的","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和所有稱為我名下的國。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"此乃行這事的耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日子將到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耕種的必接續收割的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踹葡萄的必接續撒種的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大山要滴下甜酒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小山都必流奶","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使我民以色列被擄的歸回；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必重修荒廢的城邑居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽種葡萄園，喝其中所出的酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修造果木園，吃其中的果子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要將他們栽於本地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不再從我所賜給他們的地上拔出來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華－你的上帝說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"原文是消化，見約珥三章十八節","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/OBA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}